      "text": "To resolve error code **ERR-DN-PRNT-24V** (TH230 Thermal Printer Power Sag / Cutter Lock) on Diebold Nixdorf BEETLE A1150 POS terminals, follow the certified procedure from the [Diebold Nixdorf BEETLE A1150 POS Hardware & Diagnostics Guide](https://storage.cloud.google.com/da-advanced-new-module1-bucket/store_pos_manual_generic/Diebold_Nixdorf_Beetle_A1150_Guide.pdf):

### Resolution Protocol:
1. **Power Off Printer:** Turn off the TH230 printer switch located on the front bezel.
2. **Clear Paper Jam:** Open the top cover and remove any jammed receipt paper fragments from the rotary cutter.
3. **Reseat Cable:** Reseat the 24V PoweredUSB cable in the modular I/O slot on the BEETLE A1150 terminal.
4. **Test Paper Feed:** Power on the TH230 printer and press the **Feed** key to verify paper advancement.

### Escalation Path:
